{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PINGORILE</strong> is a charming retro-style jump\u2019n\u2019run where you play as a small, round penguin with a big dream \u2013 to fly.<br>Inspired by a quirky TV show, the penguin sets out on a journey to find <strong>12 golden budgies</strong> scattered across colorful and varied levels. A mysterious ostrich from the show has promised that anyone who collects them all will achieve the ability to fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/4f13abdd94d004714b3dc7c26046fd2f.apng?t=1762180890\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/4f13abdd94d004714b3dc7c26046fd2f.poster.avif?t=1762180890\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=141 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and explore vibrant pixel worlds full of surprises, secrets, and captivating music.<br>Each level brings new challenges \u2013 from tricky platforming sections to relaxing moments \u2013 all wrapped in nostalgic 2D style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/b046b21965a078372aeaa373c77ffd6d.apng?t=1762180890\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/b046b21965a078372aeaa373c77ffd6d.poster.avif?t=1762180890\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic jump\u2019n\u2019run gameplay with smooth controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many creative and varied levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous budgies to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals and an original, diverse soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help him achieve his impossible dream?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889940?t=1762180890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889940?t=1762180890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/6a22903b7b66d8c85f0be43bd6092cbd87ef9ee3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762180890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/6a22903b7b66d8c85f0be43bd6092cbd87ef9ee3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762180890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PINGORILE</strong> is a charming retro-style jump\u2019n\u2019run where you play as a small, round penguin with a big dream \u2013 to fly.<br>Inspired by a quirky TV show, the penguin sets out on a journey to find <strong>12 golden budgies</strong> scattered across colorful and varied levels. A mysterious ostrich from the show has promised that anyone who collects them all will achieve the ability to fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/4f13abdd94d004714b3dc7c26046fd2f.apng?t=1762180890\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889940/extras/4f13abdd94d004714b3dc7c26046fd2f.poster.avif?t=1762180890\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=141 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and explore vibrant pixel worlds full of surprises, secrets, and captivating music.<br>Each level brings new challenges \u2013 from tricky pla